nosis of tuberculosis in South India</article-title><source>Int J Tuberc Lung Dis</source><year>2002</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>789</fpage><lpage>795</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12234134</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rao</surname><given-names>VK</given-names></name><name><surname>Iademarco</surname><given-names>EP</given-names></name><name><surname>Fraser</surname><given-names>VJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kollef</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Delays in the Suspicion and Treatment of Tuberculosis among Hospitalized Patients</article-title><source>Annals of Internal Medicine</source><year>1999</year><volume>130</volume><fpage>404</fpage><lpage>411</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10068414</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Golub</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Bur</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cronin</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name><name><surname>Gange</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Baruch</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Comstock</surname><given-names>GW</given-names></name><name><surname>Chaisson</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Patient and health care system delays in pulmonary tuberculosis diagnosis in a low-incidence state</article-title><source>Int J Tuberc Lung Dis</source><year>2005</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>992</fpage><lpage>998</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16158891</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Al-Maniri</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Al-Rawas</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Al-Tuhami<